# redirect — request examples for the VS Code REST Client / JetBrains HTTP Client
@redirect = http://localhost:8080

### Landing page
GET {{redirect}}/

### Follow a short link (expect 302 + Location + Cache-Control: no-store)
GET {{redirect}}/wiki

### Unknown slug (404, HTML)
GET {{redirect}}/does-not-exist

### Ops
GET {{redirect}}/health
###
GET {{redirect}}/ready
###
GET {{redirect}}/metrics
